(card "exp:C6.4_top3_expand" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:C6.4_top3_expand"
  :body "---\nnav: 15\ntype: experiment\nid: C6.4\nshort_name: top3_expand\ntitle: \"C6.4 — top-3 expand (R6 NAV champion before timing filter)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: c\nround: r6\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_c__no_open3min]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.5108\ntrain_trade_count: 142\ntrain_win_rate: 0.9014\ntrain_sharpe: 9.0539\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0047\nval_nav_mean: 1.0760\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0769\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: champion\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [whitelist]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/c, round/r6, axis/whitelist, status/champion, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# C6.4 — top-3 expand (R6 NAV champion)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— Team C R6 NAV champion，**Top-N expand 机制的\"3\" 档定型**：每秒同 trigger 接 top-3 leg (vs anchor 默认 top-1)。train NAV 2.51 / 142 笔 / win 90.1% / sharpe 9.05 全部漂亮。test 未单跑（后续 C7.5 / C8.4 在它上面叠 filter 后才上 test）—— vault 留它作为 **top-N expand axis 的 anchor 起点**。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：anchor 默认 top-1 picker 浪费了同 trigger 的 top-2 / top-3 leg；这些 leg ratio 略低但仍 informative，应当接进 pool。\n- top-3 = R6 sweep [top-2, top-3, top-4, top-5] 里 NAV 最高档（C7.1 top-4 / C7.2 top-5 略低）。\n- 期待：trade_count 翻倍至 280 左右，NAV 升 20-30%。\n- 实测：trade_count 142（仅 +2，因 top-2/3 leg 多数被 volume cap 砍 → 后续 R8 加 bypass 才接进来），NAV 升 +15%。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_c/scripts/round_6_runner.py`\n- 步骤：anchor G2 → 每个 trigger 选 top-3 (vs default top-1)\n- 输出 142 笔。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 无 rolling stat。`#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.5108 | 142 | 9.05 | 90.1% | -0.47% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0760 ± 0.077 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n| **Δ train NAV vs anchor** | +0.323 | +2 | +1.36 | +4.4pp | +0.54pp |\n\n注意 win_rate 90.1% / sharpe 9.05 都是 arc 全候选最高之一 —— top-3 expand 没引入新 noise leg，只是恢复了 anchor 没picked 的 strong leg。\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0。\n- 未跑 test 不是因为失败，是因为 C7.5 / C8.4 在它上面叠 filter 后 NAV 更高，直接以后者跑 test。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **same_metrics_as**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__baseline_C6.4__top3_expand]]\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]] (直接套 anchor + top-3)\n- **descendants**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__C7.5__top3_no_open3min]] (R7 加 no_open_3min), [[arc_260516a__team_c__C8.4__top3_no_open3min_bypass]] (R8 再加 bypass)\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__C7.3__top3_rolling_baserate]] (R7 alt 路线)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_c/output/cross_round_leaderboard.csv` (C6.4 row)\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/output/top3_strategies_explainer_20260517_0015.html`\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **top-N expand axis** 是 Team C 整个 lineage 的核心 lever。下次 trade selector arc 必须 reuse top-3 起点（top-4 / top-5 已在 C7.1/7.2 验过：略低 NAV，stick with top-3）。\n- 没跑 test 的原因 = \"更强的 descendant 已跑 test\" —— 这种\"剪枝\"决定是合理的，但 vault 仍应留 stub 给 lineage 追溯。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_c__C6.4__top3_expand.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:24:30+08:00"
